      "type": "{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What does the Stripe integration do?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"It adds a secure Stripe payment step to your form, so you can collect payments for products, services, donations, or registrations as part of the submission.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I add Stripe payments to a form?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Add Stripe from Integrations → Payment and log in to connect. Then add a calculation field for your total, drop in the Stripe payment element linked with @, pick a currency, and publish.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the amount change based on answers?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes — link the payment amount to a calculation field and it updates dynamically with quantities, selected items, or options.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Which currencies are supported?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"You can charge in USD, CAD, EUR, and other major currencies, selected per payment field.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How do I test before going live?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Use Stripe's test mode to run sample transactions and verify your calculation logic with different item combinations before enabling live payments.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is Formester?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Formester is an online form builder for creating forms, surveys, and quizzes with a drag-and-drop editor or AI. It connects with the tools your team already uses — Google Sheets, Slack, HubSpot, Zapier, and more — so your form data flows wherever you need it.\"}}]}"
