      "faqList": [
        {
          "id": 2817,
          "header": "What does the Stripe integration do?",
          "body": "It adds a secure Stripe payment step to your form, so you can collect payments for products, services, donations, or registrations as part of the submission.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2814,
          "header": "How do I add Stripe payments to a form?",
          "body": "Add Stripe from Integrations → Payment and log in to connect. Then add a calculation field for your total, drop in the Stripe payment element linked with @, pick a currency, and publish.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2813,
          "header": "Can the amount change based on answers?",
          "body": "Yes — link the payment amount to a calculation field and it updates dynamically with quantities, selected items, or options.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2815,
          "header": "Which currencies are supported?",
          "body": "You can charge in USD, CAD, EUR, and other major currencies, selected per payment field.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2816,
          "header": "How do I test before going live?",
          "body": "Use Stripe's test mode to run sample transactions and verify your calculation logic with different item combinations before enabling live payments.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2818,
          "header": "What is Formester?",
          "body": "Formester is an online form builder for creating forms, surveys, and quizzes with a drag-and-drop editor or AI. It connects with the tools your team already uses — Google Sheets, Slack, HubSpot, Zapier, and more — so your form data flows wherever you need it.",
          "body_markdown": "",
          "list": []
        }
      ]
    },
